---
// Quick start — 4 steps + install command
---
<section id="start" style="background:#F4F1E9;padding:88px 32px;">
  <div style="max-width:1000px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div data-reveal style="text-align:center;max-width:560px;margin:0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="font:600 12px 'IBM Plex Mono';letter-spacing:.2em;color:#E8722A;text-transform:uppercase;">Quick start</div>
      <h2 style="margin:14px 0 0;font:700 42px/1.1 'Space Grotesk';color:#0B1220;letter-spacing:-.02em;">Wire agent context in under a minute.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="dc-grid-4" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:16px;">
      <div data-reveal style="background:#FBF9F3;border:1px solid #e7e0d0;border-radius:15px;padding:22px;">
        <div style="font:700 15px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#F4F1E9;background:#FF8A3D;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">1</div>
        <h4 style="margin:15px 0 7px;font:600 16px 'Space Grotesk';color:#0B1220;">Install</h4>
        <p style="margin:0;font:400 13.5px/1.55 'IBM Plex Sans';color:#5a5f6c;">From the VS Code Marketplace or Open VSX.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="background:#FBF9F3;border:1px solid #e7e0d0;border-radius:15px;padding:22px;">
        <div style="font:700 15px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#F4F1E9;background:#FF8A3D;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">2</div>
        <h4 style="margin:15px 0 7px;font:600 16px 'Space Grotesk';color:#0B1220;">Capture context</h4>
        <p style="margin:0;font:400 13.5px/1.55 'IBM Plex Sans';color:#5a5f6c;">Highlight code, press <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';color:#0B1220;">⌘⌥N</span>, note what it assumes.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="background:#FBF9F3;border:1px solid #e7e0d0;border-radius:15px;padding:22px;">
        <div style="font:700 15px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#F4F1E9;background:#FF8A3D;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">3</div>
        <h4 style="margin:15px 0 7px;font:600 16px 'Space Grotesk';color:#0B1220;">Exported for agents</h4>
        <p style="margin:0;font:400 13.5px/1.55 'IBM Plex Sans';color:#5a5f6c;"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';color:#0B1220;">AGENTS.md</span> + <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono';color:#0B1220;">INDEX.json</span> regenerate automatically.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-reveal style="background:#0B1220;border-radius:15px;padding:22px;">
        <div style="font:700 15px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#0B1220;background:#57B6A9;width:30px;height:30px;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;">4</div>
        <h4 style="margin:15px 0 7px;font:600 16px 'Space Grotesk';color:#F4F1E9;">Connect your agent</h4>
        <p style="margin:0;font:400 13.5px/1.55 'IBM Plex Sans';color:#9BA3B4;">Start the MCP server and pick a trust mode.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div data-reveal style="margin-top:24px;background:#0B1220;border-radius:14px;padding:18px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;">
      <span style="font:500 13px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#57B6A9;">$</span>
      <span style="font:500 14px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#c8d1e0;flex:1;">code --install-extension jnahian.code-context-notes</span>
      <span style="font:500 12px 'IBM Plex Mono';color:#6B7488;">copy</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
